":true,"settings":{"icon":"picto-question","mobile_icon_width":24,"icon_width":32,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"Do I need to pay before seeing the 3D design?","content":"<p>Yes, but not the full amount. Only a minimum deposit is required to ensure we’re all set to complete your project. Once the deposit is paid, your 3D-designing is proceeded right away!<\/p>"}},"item_tKnfHF":{"type":"item","disabled":true,"settings":{"icon":"picto-recycle","mobile_icon_width":24,"icon_width":32,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"What if I don't like my 3D design?","content":"<p>If you're not satisfied with your 3D design yet, we're happy to adjust it based on your feedbacks until it meets your highest expectation—at no additional cost. <br\/>Additionally, if you decide not to continue with the project after reviewing the 3D design—though this rarely happens—we do offer a Refund Policy for your peace of mind!<\/p>"}},"item_cQADHb":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"picto-chat","mobile_icon_width":24,"icon_width":32,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"Communication is key!","content":"<p>We'll keep you updated by texts, images, videos or calls via Instagram to ensure you always get real-time updates about your order. Your satisfaction is our priority!<\/p>"}},"item_dwG3Vi":{"type":"item","disabled":true,"settings":{"icon":"picto-validation","mobile_icon_width":24,"icon_width":32,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"Official pages","content":"<p>All these are official! We're all here happy to assist you to custom your unforgettable statue^^!<\/p>"}},"item_i6nrbd":{"type":"item","disabled":true,"settings":{"icon":"picto-comment","mobile_icon_width":24,"icon_width":32,"icon_background_type":"none","icon_background":"","icon_color":"","title":"How can I send over my photos?","content":"<p>You can start by contacting us via o